# AA-979: what `vercel deploy` (vercel-deploy-portal.yml, run from the repo root) leaves out of the upload for the
# tenant portal project (Root Directory `portal`). The portal build reads nothing outside portal/ (guarded by
# api/tests/unit/test_portal_guards.py). Every line is anchored with a leading `/`: an unanchored `api/` would also
# drop portal/app/api/ (the BFF routes).
/api
/web
/docs
/e2e
/tools
